; The autonomous archetype: cast it and it keeps working somewhere you are not.
;
; BaseProjectileCount is how many wards may burn at once, not how many are made per cast - one is
; made per cooldown until the cap is reached. Pure Light, so it is attuned, which is the trade a
; single-tag spell gets for the second tag it does not carry.

